# Pop: a straight-eighths pop band at ~105. Drums from the Groove MIDI Dataset (drummer 3, a rock groove at
# 105, CC BY 4.0: styles/README.md), the rest written for Polly over C M7.
# Main A: kick-locked bass, a 3-3-2 piano, soft strings. Main B: the drummer on the ride, an eighth-note
# bass with passing notes, eighth piano, a clean guitar arpeggio, tambourine, the strings up.
